"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the January 15 Aeroplan award via Hong Kong if the shorter journey and lower reported CAD tax quote matter most. The tradeoff is a much later arrival than the Taipei option. These are the two selected award choices, not a complete view of the search results.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J1@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T10:35\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan award via Hong Kong\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO at 11:15 p.m. January 15 and arrives in Bangkok at 10:35 a.m. January 17. It is an economy award, quoted at 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 107.40 in taxes; the quote scope is unknown, so neither amount is established as per-person or all-in. The route connects in Hong Kong with a reported 1-hour-45-minute wait. For the requested one traveler, award support passed and 2 seats were reported, but the returned traveler count was absent; confirm current availability and the quote before booking. Leg-by-leg cabins were not reported.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T03\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Compared with the Taipei award below, this Hong Kong option has a reported elapsed time 125 minutes shorter. It also has the lower raw CAD tax quote, but the quote scopes are unknown. The Taipei option arrives 9 hours 10 minutes earlier and departs 11 hours 15 minutes earlier.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan award via Taipei\",\"v\":\"This is the better fit if an earlier Bangkok arrival matters more than the shorter journey: it arrives at 1:25 a.m. January 17, compared with 10:35 a.m. for the Hong Kong choice. It departs SFO at noon January 15 and connects in Taipei with a reported 4-hour-30-minute wait. The economy award is also 65,000 Aeroplan points, with a CAD 116.50 tax quote of unknown scope. One seat was reported and award support passed for the requested one traveler; the returned traveler count was absent. Confirm current availability and the quote. Leg-by-leg cabins were not reported.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline via Singapore\",\"v\":\"The selected cash itinerary is quoted at USD 440, with unknown quote scope. It departs SFO at 9:40 a.m. January 15, connects in Singapore, and arrives in Bangkok at 8:25 a.m. January 17; reported duration is 31 hours 45 minutes. This is a separate cash baseline, not an established all-in or directly comparable cost against awards quoted in points plus CAD taxes.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For either award, the reported 65,000 points are Aeroplan points, and each award’s fee quote is in CAD; the cash quote is in USD. The unknown quote scopes prevent treating any of these amounts as a party total or a per-traveler amount. Search results may not be real-time, so verify availability and current prices with the booking provider before deciding.\"}]}"
